// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3564312815" "{Hero.gender=male It is my blessing to meet you, sir. | It is my blessing to meet you, lady.}  I am not as gifted with words as the Senator, but I need your help so I will be brief.  <br><br>I need soldiers to keep the seed of all our power from a very dangerous foe, a demigod from Hades who seeks to steal this power from humanity and use it for himself and his ilk. These are dark times here in Cimerora and my allies are few. To prove to me that you are a person whom I may trust, I would have you fulfill a task for me."
// AcceptString :
"P421357054" "Accept Marcus's task to prove yourself"
// SendOffString :
"P677279434" "Excellent... {HeroName}, is it?  An unfamiliar name, I admit.  No matter.  I am a soldier, not a poet.<br><br>Your task is simple: Romulus' men have been using one of the caves here on the peninsula as a 'meeting ground' of sorts.  Inside, a man by the name of <color red>{First_Name} {Last_Name}</color> riles up those traitorous dogs just before a raid on our post.<br><br>I have information that tells me he is gearing his men up for another one soon.  I need you to stop him, and his men, before they attack us again.<br><br><color orange>You have 45 minutes to complete this mission.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1047906965" "Defeat {First_Name} {Last_Name}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P275179318" "I would hunt him down like the dog that he is, but I cannot leave my post. My first order is to keep the Emperor safe and manage our men. Do this for me, {HeroName}, and - I beg you - be quick. Time grows short."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1304939921" "Ale, sweat, and the cries of men gearing up for mayhem. This is, most definitely, the place. Time for a little smackdown, ancient-style."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 20 B_Boss :
"P1256631587" "<em Lecture t=6>Today, our attack on Cimerora will deal a killing blow to Imperious and his pathetic army.  <em crossarms t=6>Once we have defeated the majority of his soldiers, we will move in for the kill. The women and all their resources will be ours. <em laugh t=8>Cimerora will be but one of our many conquered lands.  Soon Romulus will spread his legion across the world!"

