// Dialog :
"P477687815" "You bested {First_Name} {Last_Name}? I knew my faith was not misplaced, {HeroName}. I do now believe I can trust you with my most important tasks. That is, if you are willing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1700771058" "{First_Name} {Last_Name} bested you in battle? It is true that he is a strong foe, but he must be stopped!  Perhaps now that you understand his actions in battle, you can defeat him.  Would you try again?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7-9_CP_Valerius_KillBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - First_Name 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Last_Name 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2094206229" "The attack begins in less than an hour. Another blow to that pitiful Imperious and his rag tag army.<em>Perhaps we will steal away with their women as well."
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P136384470" "We will knock him while he is down! Get ready! I want to lay siege to the town within the hour!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P582096063" "Within the hour, we will attack that pathetic hold of Imperious! Lay siege, men! Leave nothing behind!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3326726432" "His soldiers are demoralized; he has lost his kingdom! We will use this next siege to cripple him completely!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3890529419" "The pathetic dog thinks his ragtag army of whelps and pups can actually help him regain his kingdom! What an old fool!<em>Quickly! We lay siege to his fort within the hour!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3531890455" "We will crush Imperious and his loyal dogs under our heels! He knows he cannot win now!<em>Quickly! We march on the fort within the hour!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1028689152" "What an old fool Imperious is! Does he honestly think Marcus Valerius can help him organize an army strong enough to oppose us? <em>He's spending too much time in the cups!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3789066312" "Okay, men! Time moves by too quickly now. We must get to the fort and lay siege to it, as ordered. Let's go!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P984297784" "Soon it will be time! Let us land the final blow to crush Imperious' pathetic fortress and stamp out this attempt to regain control! The kingdom belongs to Romulus!"
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3969706367" "Romulus will reign over the kingdom in Cimerora long after the bones of Imperious have turned to dust! <em>Ready yourselves! We attack the fort within the hour!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2402705177" "What foul thing are you?"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1677399763" "Who has sent you to your death, stranger?"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1258931367" "If you fight for Imperious, you fight for nothing!"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2363623437" "Lay on!"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3931095914" "Your time is at an end, stranger!"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3666250729" "Another dog sent by Imperious!"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2329517655" "{Hero.gender=male Sieze him! | Seize her!}"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3095835139" "For Romulus!"
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3575261977" "Death to Imperous!"

